cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StickStage in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "StickStage: an open-source stick figure comedy video generator"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tamtree"
    website: "https://www.tamtree.io"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tamtree-ai/stick-stage"
url: "https://github.com/tamtree-ai/stick-stage"
abstract: >-
  StickStage turns a written premise into a captioned, lip-synced 9:16 comedy short.
  Voices (Kokoro), lip sync (Rhubarb) and frame-by-frame rendering (Remotion) all run
  offline, and every skit, character, set and prop is a JSON document.
keywords:
  - stick figure video generator
  - text to video
  - comedy shorts
  - Remotion
  - lip sync
  - text to speech
  - offline
